# Cloudflare Pages — HTTP Security Headers
# Applied at the CDN edge. Replace CLOUD_RUN_URL with your actual Cloud Run URL.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# CSP NOTES:
#   - 'unsafe-inline' required for style-src: Next.js injects inline critical CSS
#   - 'unsafe-eval' required for script-src: webpack runtime uses eval() in dev;
#     Remove it after verifying production works without it.
#   - font-src includes data: for Geist font data URIs
#   - connect-src: restrict to ONLY your Cloud Run domain in production
#   - worker-src blob: required for Three.js WebGL workers

/*
  X-DNS-Prefetch-Control: on
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.run.app https: http://localhost:* http://127.0.0.1:*; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-ancestors 'none';
